---
/**
 * FAQ / Objection Handling — accordion of the 5 most common objections.
 * Native <details>/<summary> for zero-JS, accessible accordion.
 * Positioned after CaseStudies, before mid-page CTA.
 * Hardcoded content — no props needed.
 */
---

<section id="faq" class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32">

    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mb-10 md:mb-14 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-default">
        Still have questions?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted">
        Here are the ones we hear most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion -->
    <div class="divide-y divide-slate-200 border-t border-b border-slate-200 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">

      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-5 text-lg font-semibold font-heading text-default select-none">
          How much does this cost?
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Every business is different, so we scope projects to fit &mdash; not the other way around.
          Most engagements pay for themselves within the first quarter through time savings alone.
          We'll walk through pricing on your free Data Health Check so you can decide with full context, no pressure.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-5 text-lg font-semibold font-heading text-default select-none">
          How long until I see results?
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Most clients have their first live dashboard within 6 weeks. You'll start seeing
          patterns in your data almost immediately &mdash; the kind of clarity that used to take
          a full quarter of manual work.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-5 text-lg font-semibold font-heading text-default select-none">
          We're not technical &mdash; is this still for us?
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          That's exactly who we built this for. We handle the technical side so you don't have to.
          If you can use email, you can use your dashboard. No training manuals, no IT department
          required.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-5 text-lg font-semibold font-heading text-default select-none">
          What if we only have a small team?
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Most of our clients have 10&ndash;50 employees. Our solutions are sized for your business
          &mdash; not scaled down from something built for a Fortune 500. A smaller team actually
          means faster implementation and bigger impact per person.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-5 text-lg font-semibold font-heading text-default select-none">
          What makes you different from a big consulting firm?
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          We work exclusively with SMBs. No $500K enterprise projects. No 6-month timelines.
          No jargon. You get direct access to the person doing the work &mdash; not a junior
          analyst three layers removed from the partner who sold you the engagement.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
